सम्-√ 3. मा P. Ā. -माति, -मिमीते, to measure out, measure, RV. &c. &c.;
to make of the same measure, make equal, equalize (in size, number, quantity &c.), AV.; TS.; ŚBr. ;
to compare with (instr.), BhP.;
to mete out, distribute, bestow, RV. iii, 1, 15; v, 4, 2;
 (with श्र॑वांसि) to direct one's course or flight towards, ib. iii, 34, 22;
to be of the same capacity with, be contained in (loc.), Kuval. :
Pass. -मीयते, to be of the same measure, be contained in (loc.), Nīlak.
